WEBVTT

00:01.332 --> 00:04.263
<i>[tropical music]</i>
<i>[热带音乐]</i>

00:04.332 --> 00:11.229
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:13.194 --> 00:15.505
[creaking]
[吱吱作响]

00:15.574 --> 00:18.505
<i>[romantic music]</i>
<i>[浪漫音乐]</i>

00:18.574 --> 00:21.608
Aah, I'm floating on air.
啊啊，我飘在空中了。

00:21.677 --> 00:24.436
A balloon ride,
a candlelight dinner,
乘坐气球，
烛光晚餐，

00:24.505 --> 00:27.160
and our wedding song is playing!
我们的婚礼歌曲正在播放！

00:27.229 --> 00:28.746
This date is perfect.
这次约会很完美。

00:28.815 --> 00:31.263
No, you're perfect, Karen.
不，你很完美，凯伦。

00:31.332 --> 00:34.815
You're the best computer wife
a copepod could ever have!
你是最好的电脑老婆
桡足类动物可能有！

00:37.229 --> 00:38.539
Bon bon?
邦邦？

00:38.608 --> 00:40.643
Oh, I shouldn't.
哦，我不应该。

00:40.712 --> 00:43.815
Indulge yourself, my darling.
放纵一下自己吧，亲爱的。

00:43.884 --> 00:45.539
Thank you, Plankton!
谢谢你，浮游生物！

00:45.608 --> 00:48.332
This is truly
a date to remember.
这确实是
一个值得记住的日期。

00:48.401 --> 00:52.160
Well, my love, you haven't
seen anything yet!
好吧，我的爱人，你还没有
还没有看到什么！

00:53.712 --> 00:55.781
For you, my love.
为了你，我的爱人。

00:55.850 --> 00:59.125
Ohh, Ray Ray!
噢，雷雷！

00:59.194 --> 01:00.194
[sniffing]
[嗅嗅]

01:00.229 --> 01:01.815
Aah...
啊……

01:01.884 --> 01:03.470
That's right, baby.
没错，宝贝。

01:03.539 --> 01:05.953
Ray Ray is at your service.
雷雷竭诚为您服务。

01:07.332 --> 01:11.160
Ray Ray, you've got my
cooling fans running on high.
雷雷，你有我的
冷却风扇高速运转。

01:11.229 --> 01:14.022
Ha, ha. Get over here
and give me some sugar!
哈，哈。到这里来
并给我一些糖！

01:14.091 --> 01:16.988
[kissing sounds]
[接吻声]

01:17.057 --> 01:18.815
Huh?
啊？

01:18.884 --> 01:20.160
♪ Do do do do do ♪
♪ 做做做做做 ♪

01:20.229 --> 01:21.367
[yawns]
[哈欠]

01:21.436 --> 01:23.332
What a long day.
多么漫长的一天啊。

01:23.401 --> 01:28.574
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

01:28.643 --> 01:29.815
[kissing sounds]
[接吻声]

01:29.884 --> 01:31.401
<i>[angelic singing]</i>
<i>[天使般的歌声]</i>

01:31.470 --> 01:32.919
Uh... eh... ehh!
呃……呃……呃！

01:32.988 --> 01:35.263
Ahhh!
I can't take it!
啊啊！
我受不了！

01:35.332 --> 01:36.539
What is it, Plankton?
这是什么，浮游生物？

01:36.608 --> 01:37.850
Hold that thought, baby.
保持这个想法，宝贝。

01:37.919 --> 01:39.608
I uh...
I forgot something down here.
我呃...
我把东西忘在这里了。

01:39.677 --> 01:41.884
I'll be right back!
我马上回来！

01:41.953 --> 01:44.953
Can't believe this is really happening.
不敢相信这真的发生了。

01:45.022 --> 01:46.298
Oh!
哦！

01:46.367 --> 01:49.298
The Krabby Patty secret formula
is finally mine!
蟹黄饼的秘密配方
终于是我的了！

01:49.367 --> 01:51.401
Huh?
啊？

01:51.470 --> 01:52.712
Huh?
啊？

01:52.781 --> 01:54.229
Eh...
呃……

01:54.298 --> 01:55.401
Ehh!
呃！

01:55.470 --> 01:58.229
Hm, eh, ah, eh, eh!
嗯嗯嗯嗯！

01:58.298 --> 02:01.574
Is this some kind
of horrible nightmare?
这是某种吗
可怕的噩梦？

02:01.643 --> 02:02.574
What?
什么？

02:02.643 --> 02:04.919
A projector?
投影仪？

02:04.988 --> 02:07.850
You tricked me
with a simulation?
你欺骗了我
通过模拟？

02:07.919 --> 02:10.401
It was a test, Plankton!
这是一次考验，浮游生物！

02:10.470 --> 02:12.332
And you failed!
而你失败了！

02:12.401 --> 02:15.539
You fail every time when it
comes to our romance.
每次你都会失败
来到我们的浪漫。

02:15.608 --> 02:19.125
Right, so I goof up one time
and now I'm the bad guy?
是的，所以我搞砸了一次
现在我是坏人了？

02:19.194 --> 02:22.022
One time?
Failed <i>one</i> time?
一度？
失败<i>一次</i>次？

02:22.091 --> 02:25.263
How about 4,700,000 and...
4,700,000 怎么样？

02:25.332 --> 02:28.574
[glitching]
Error, er-er-error.
[故障]
错误，呃呃错误。

02:28.643 --> 02:30.367
But baby cakes,
但婴儿蛋糕，

02:30.436 --> 02:33.712
I left to go get the
Krabby Patty secret formula.
我离开去拿
蟹黄派秘方。

02:33.781 --> 02:35.988
For me...
And you...
对我来说...
而你...

02:36.057 --> 02:38.125
You know... for us!
你知道...为了我们！

02:38.194 --> 02:39.815
Ehhh?
呃？

02:39.884 --> 02:41.677
Listen, Sheldon.
听着，谢尔顿。

02:41.746 --> 02:44.194
You need to show me
an interruption-free
你需要告诉我
无中断的

02:44.263 --> 02:47.781
romantic date night because
until that happens
浪漫的约会之夜，因为
直到那件事发生

02:47.850 --> 02:51.505
no one is leaving
the Chum Bucket.
没有人离开
密友桶。

02:51.574 --> 02:52.643
[alarm sounds]
[警报声]

02:52.712 --> 02:54.401
Aah!
啊啊！

02:54.470 --> 02:57.401
<i>[intense music]</i>
<i>[激烈的音乐]</i>

02:57.470 --> 03:01.263
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:01.332 --> 03:02.608
Oof!
钱币！

03:02.677 --> 03:05.539
You better not mess
this one up, Ray Ray.
你最好别乱来
这个，雷雷。

03:05.608 --> 03:08.160
Ah!
啊!

03:08.229 --> 03:10.505
♪ Da da da da doo doo ♪
♪ 哒哒哒哒嘟嘟 ♪

03:10.574 --> 03:13.953
I think Karen's favorite
"scrap electronics stew"
我觉得凯伦最喜欢
“废旧电子产品炖菜”

03:14.022 --> 03:15.229
ought to do the trick.
应该可以解决问题。

03:15.298 --> 03:16.953
[laughing]
[笑]

03:17.022 --> 03:19.194
Yep.
Huh?
是的。
啊？

03:19.263 --> 03:22.332
I guess it wouldn't hurt
to have just a little peek
我想这不会造成伤害
稍微看一下

03:22.401 --> 03:24.298
at the Krusty Krab.
在蟹堡王。

03:24.367 --> 03:26.022
Hmm.
唔。

03:26.091 --> 03:27.263
♪ Dee dee doo dee ♪
♪ 迪迪迪迪迪 ♪

03:27.332 --> 03:29.608
What a long day.
多么漫长的一天啊。

03:29.677 --> 03:31.781
[yawns]
[哈欠]

03:31.850 --> 03:35.194
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:35.263 --> 03:36.057
[gasps]
[喘气]

03:36.125 --> 03:37.884
It's really out there!
真的就在外面！

03:37.953 --> 03:39.919
And this time
it's not a hologram!
而这一次
这不是全息图！

03:39.988 --> 03:42.539
[scratching and whimpering]
[抓挠和呜咽]

03:42.608 --> 03:43.781
Uh, uh...
呃，呃……

03:43.850 --> 03:45.505
[clearing throat]
Plankton.
[清嗓子]
浮游生物。

03:45.574 --> 03:46.470
What are you doing?
你在干什么？

03:46.539 --> 03:47.884
Oh, hey, baby!
哦，嘿，宝贝！

03:47.953 --> 03:49.919
Just adding
the finishing touches
只需添加
最后的润色

03:49.988 --> 03:52.022
to tonight's main course!
来今晚的主菜吧！

03:52.091 --> 03:54.677
Aww, you are so sweet!
哇，你真可爱！

03:54.746 --> 03:56.677
I can't wait to try it!
我迫不及待地想尝试一下！

03:56.746 --> 03:59.367
[kissing sounds]
[接吻声]

03:59.436 --> 04:01.470
Whew!
Good one, Plankton.
哇！
好一个，浮游生物。

04:01.539 --> 04:02.953
The formula!
公式！

04:03.022 --> 04:06.022
Now how am I gonna get you?
现在我要怎样才能得到你呢？

04:06.091 --> 04:07.677
[breeze blows]
[微风吹过]

04:07.746 --> 04:10.470
Yes, yes, yes!
是的，是的，是的！

04:10.539 --> 04:11.677
No, no, no!
不，不，不！

04:11.746 --> 04:13.539
Slow it down, you maniac!
慢点，你这个疯子！

04:13.608 --> 04:14.746
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

04:14.815 --> 04:15.919
Who's that?
那是谁？

04:15.988 --> 04:17.367
Krabby Patty!
Krabby Patty!
蟹蟹帕蒂！
蟹蟹帕蒂！

04:17.436 --> 04:20.815
Eesh.
It's that numbskull Patrick.
哎呀。
就是那个麻木的帕特里克。

04:20.884 --> 04:23.781
Hey, doofus!
I mean, star friend.
嘿，傻瓜！
我是说，明星朋友。

04:23.850 --> 04:25.988
Krabby Patty.
克拉比·帕蒂。

04:26.057 --> 04:27.539
- Over here.
- Hmm?
- 在这里。
- 唔？

04:27.608 --> 04:29.298
No, over here!
不，在这里！

04:29.367 --> 04:30.988
Come on.
快点。

04:31.057 --> 04:32.539
Yes, that's it.
是的，就是这样。

04:32.608 --> 04:33.850
You've got it.
你已经明白了。

04:33.919 --> 04:36.436
Now who's a good boy?
现在谁是好孩子？

04:36.505 --> 04:37.850
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

04:37.919 --> 04:41.919
Okay, now grab that bottle
by your feet there.
好的，现在拿起那个瓶子
在你的脚那里。

04:41.988 --> 04:43.263
No.
不。

04:43.332 --> 04:44.470
[sighs]
[叹气]

04:44.539 --> 04:46.574
The other drink container
by your feet.
另一个饮料容器
在你的脚下。

04:46.643 --> 04:49.125
- Hmm.
- Pick that one up instead.
- 唔。
- 选择那个。

04:49.194 --> 04:50.470
- Uh?
- By your feet.
- 呃？
- 在你的脚边。

04:50.539 --> 04:51.919
Huh? Uh?
啊？呃？

04:51.988 --> 04:53.298
Now look right!
现在看对了！

04:53.367 --> 04:54.815
Oh, huh!
哦，哈！

04:54.884 --> 04:56.953
You have got to be kidding me.
你一定是在跟我开玩笑吧。

04:57.022 --> 04:58.401
Right, Patrick!
对了，帕特里克！

04:58.470 --> 05:01.608
- Uh?
- Your other right!
- 呃？
- 你的另一项权利！

05:01.677 --> 05:02.884
- Oh!
- Yes!
- 哦！
- 是的！

05:02.953 --> 05:04.057
[laughter]
[笑声]

05:04.125 --> 05:05.815
That's it, huh!
就这样吧，呵呵！

05:05.884 --> 05:07.746
- Ah!
- Good boy.
- 啊！
- 好孩子。

05:07.815 --> 05:11.367
Now bring it over here to me.
Yes, that's it!
现在把它拿过来给我。
是的，就是这样！

05:11.436 --> 05:12.988
Huh?
啊？

05:13.057 --> 05:14.574
Oh, where did he go?!
哦，他去哪儿了？

05:14.643 --> 05:17.436
Excuse me, are you
the window cleaner?
对不起，你是
窗户清洁工？

05:17.505 --> 05:20.298
How in barnacles
did you get in here?
如何在藤壶中
你进来了吗？

05:20.367 --> 05:22.125
- I dunno?
- Well, who cares?
- 我不知道？
- 好吧，谁在乎呢？

05:22.194 --> 05:24.919
Did you bring that bottle
I told you to bring?
你带那个瓶子了吗
我告诉你要带吗？

05:24.988 --> 05:26.953
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

05:27.022 --> 05:29.505
Tastes kinda funny, though.
不过味道有点搞笑。

05:29.574 --> 05:32.988
No, I said the other one,
you moron!
不，我说的是另一个，
你这个白痴！

05:34.057 --> 05:36.057
Hey, you guys are doing great!
嘿，你们做得很棒！

05:36.125 --> 05:38.677
Two, three, four.
二、三、四。

05:38.746 --> 05:42.091
A thin piece of glass is all
that stands between me
一块薄玻璃就是全部
挡在我之间的

05:42.160 --> 05:44.850
and what I want most
in the world.
以及我最想要的
在世界上。

05:44.919 --> 05:47.401
Why is life so unfair?
为什么生活如此不公平？

05:47.470 --> 05:48.643
Oh, honey?
哦，亲爱的？

05:48.712 --> 05:51.332
Is dinner almost ready?
I'm famished!
晚饭快准备好了吗？
我饿坏了！

05:51.401 --> 05:55.643
Uh, it's almost finished,
my sweetheart!
呃，快完结了
我的甜心！

05:55.712 --> 05:57.022
What am I gonna do?
我要做什么？

05:57.091 --> 05:59.298
Think, Plankton, think!
想一想，浮游生物，想一想！

05:59.367 --> 06:00.367
Oh?
哦？

06:00.401 --> 06:01.953
Idea!
主意！

06:02.712 --> 06:04.401
That's it!
就是这样！

06:04.470 --> 06:07.401
Karen will never know
the difference!
凯伦永远不会知道
区别！

06:07.470 --> 06:10.125
Now I think I got
what I need right here.
现在我想我得到了
我在这里需要什么。

06:10.194 --> 06:12.988
Patrick, you may
feel a slight tickle.
帕特里克，你可以
感到轻微的痒痒。

06:13.057 --> 06:14.988
Oh, I like tickles.
哦，我喜欢挠痒痒。

06:15.057 --> 06:18.850
[sawing]
[锯切]

06:18.919 --> 06:20.815
Okay, let's get a look at this.
好吧，让我们看看这个。

06:20.884 --> 06:23.057
Ha, ha!
That was intense!
哈，哈！
太激烈了！

06:23.125 --> 06:25.643
Oop!
Almost forgot.
哎呀！
差点忘了。

06:25.712 --> 06:27.160
Ha, ha.
Ow!
哈，哈。
噢！

06:27.229 --> 06:31.022
You're going on a date
with my wife Karen, Ray Ray.
你要去约会
和我的妻子凯伦，雷雷。

06:31.091 --> 06:33.160
Oh, but I sound like Patrick.
哦，但我听起来像帕特里克。

06:33.229 --> 06:35.125
Oh, no.
You keep your mouth shut.
哦，不。
你闭嘴吧。

06:35.194 --> 06:36.677
I will take care of that.
我会处理的。

06:36.746 --> 06:38.815
[high-pitched feedback]
[高音反馈]

06:38.884 --> 06:41.022
[chuckles]
[笑声]

06:42.160 --> 06:43.746
<i>Oh, Karen?</i>
<i>哦，凯伦？</i>

06:43.815 --> 06:46.332
Dinner is served,
my little love nugget!
晚餐已上桌，
我的小爱金块！

06:46.401 --> 06:50.229
Oh, my gosh.
This looks amazing!
哦，天哪。
这看起来棒极了！

06:50.298 --> 06:52.781
I loves my Ray Ray.
我爱我的雷雷。

06:52.850 --> 06:54.367
[growls and giggles]
[咆哮和咯咯笑]

06:54.436 --> 06:57.298
And I love my Karen.
我爱我的凯伦。

06:57.367 --> 07:00.125
<i>Now let's dig in!</i>
<i>现在让我们开始吧！</i>

07:01.608 --> 07:04.574
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

07:04.643 --> 07:07.091
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

07:07.160 --> 07:11.057
Krabby Patty secret formula,
here I come!
蟹黄饼秘制配方，
我来了！

07:13.505 --> 07:16.367
Ow!
That's a little rough, Ray Ray.
噢！
这有点粗糙，雷雷。

07:18.091 --> 07:21.057
Ow, Plankton!
What are you doing?
噢，浮游生物！
你在干什么？

07:22.332 --> 07:24.746
Ohh.
Oh, that feels nice.
哦。
哦，那感觉真好。

07:24.815 --> 07:27.125
Ahh, okay. Goodnight.
啊，好吧。晚安。

07:27.194 --> 07:28.332
Whew.
呼。

07:28.401 --> 07:31.125
That was close.
那很接近了。

07:31.194 --> 07:35.746
Yep, we had another
money stacking day.
是的，我们还有另一个
钱堆积日。

07:35.815 --> 07:37.160
Hehehe!
呵呵呵呵！

07:37.229 --> 07:39.815
Didn't we... Huh?
我们不是……嗯？

07:39.884 --> 07:41.057
[gasps]
[喘气]

07:41.125 --> 07:43.091
Me Krabby Patty secret formuler?
我是克拉比帕蒂的秘密配方师吗？

07:43.160 --> 07:44.988
[gasps and screams]
[喘息和尖叫]

07:45.057 --> 07:46.505
It must have fell
out of me boat!
一定是掉下来了
离开我的船！

07:46.574 --> 07:49.160
Ooh, don't you worry, sweetie!
哦，别担心，亲爱的！

07:49.229 --> 07:51.160
Daddy's comin' for ya!
爸爸来找你了！

07:51.229 --> 07:53.263
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

07:53.332 --> 07:55.884
- Formuler! Formuler!
- Huh?
- 配方师！配方师！
- 啊？

07:55.953 --> 07:57.815
Where are ye, formuler?
配方师，你们在哪里？

07:57.884 --> 07:59.643
Where's me formuler?
我的配方师在哪里？

07:59.712 --> 08:02.091
What have you done
with me secret formuler?
你做了什么
和我一起秘密配方师吗？

08:02.160 --> 08:03.712
Formuler?
Where are ya?
配方师？
你在哪儿？

08:03.781 --> 08:05.815
Formuler?
配方师？

08:05.884 --> 08:07.850
Formuler!
配方师！

08:07.919 --> 08:10.677
Formuler? Formuler?
配方师？配方师？

08:10.746 --> 08:12.229
Formuler!
配方师！

08:12.298 --> 08:15.712
Where are you, formuler?
配方师，你在哪里？

08:17.194 --> 08:18.850
Plankton.
浮游生物。

08:18.919 --> 08:23.505
I know you have me formuler!
So just hand it over!
我知道你有我的配方师！
所以就交出来吧！

08:24.401 --> 08:26.022
Eee...
[blowing]
哎呀……
[吹]

08:26.091 --> 08:30.125
Open up, Plankton!
I know you've got me formuler!
打开吧，浮游生物！
我知道你已经找到了我的配方师！

08:30.194 --> 08:32.229
Huh?
Who could that be?
啊？
那会是谁？

08:32.298 --> 08:34.436
Uh, that banging noise?
呃，那种撞击声？

08:34.505 --> 08:36.608
Haha, that's just the dryer.
哈哈，这就是烘干机。

08:36.677 --> 08:40.263
<i>I thought I'd do the laundry
so you wouldn't have to later.</i>
<i>我想我会洗衣服
这样您就不必稍后再这样做。</i>

08:40.332 --> 08:41.608
<i>Kiss kiss.</i>
<i>亲吻。</i>

08:41.677 --> 08:44.298
Oh, Ray Ray!
That's the most romantic thing
哦，雷雷！
这才是最浪漫的事情

08:44.367 --> 08:45.815
you've ever said!
你曾经说过！

08:45.884 --> 08:47.746
[kissing sounds]
[接吻声]

08:47.815 --> 08:48.953
Hmm.
唔。

08:49.022 --> 08:51.746
The formula is finally mine.
公式终于是我的了。

08:51.815 --> 08:54.401
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

08:55.539 --> 08:56.953
Oh, come on!
哦，来吧！

08:57.022 --> 08:59.194
I know you're in there,
Plankton!
我知道你在里面
浮游生物！

08:59.263 --> 09:00.953
- Wha?
- Eh, eh!
- 世界卫生大会？
- 呃，呃！

09:01.022 --> 09:03.781
Formula.
公式。

09:03.850 --> 09:05.643
Thanks for holding it for me.
谢谢你帮我拿着它。

09:05.712 --> 09:07.229
[both straining]
[双方都紧张]

09:07.298 --> 09:10.057
- Urgh!
- It's mine!
- 呃！
- 这是我的！

09:10.125 --> 09:11.125
Sheldon?
谢尔顿？

09:11.194 --> 09:13.677
Today made up for everything.
今天弥补了一切。

09:13.746 --> 09:16.746
So I wanted to give you
a little something.
所以我想给你
一点东西。

09:16.815 --> 09:20.470
After years of research,
I finally synthesized the data
经过多年的研究，
我终于综合了数据

09:20.539 --> 09:24.022
and came up with the Krabby
Patty secret formula!
并想出了蟹蟹
帕蒂秘方！

09:24.091 --> 09:25.643
[gasps]
[喘气]

09:25.712 --> 09:26.643
A-ha!
啊哈！

09:26.712 --> 09:28.401
Plankton!
浮游生物！

09:28.470 --> 09:29.505
Let go!
松手！

09:29.574 --> 09:31.298
Whatever you say, Krabs!
不管你说什么，蟹蟹！

09:31.367 --> 09:32.884
Doh!
Aah!
哎哟！
啊啊！

09:32.953 --> 09:36.057
Who needs your stupid
hard copy in a bottle, anyway
谁需要你的笨蛋
无论如何，硬拷贝装在瓶子里

09:36.125 --> 09:39.884
when I have a downloadable
version right here?
当我有一个可下载的
版本在这里吗？

09:39.953 --> 09:42.022
[groans]
You jerk!
[呻吟]
你这个混蛋！

09:42.091 --> 09:44.677
[chuckling quietly]
[轻笑]

09:44.746 --> 09:46.470
Now...
现在...

09:46.539 --> 09:51.194
the secret formula is...
秘密公式是...

09:51.263 --> 09:53.057
Is what? Is what?
What is it?
是什么？是什么？
它是什么？

09:53.125 --> 09:54.367
[gasps]
[喘气]

09:54.436 --> 09:55.470
Uuugh!
呃！

09:55.539 --> 09:56.436
Ray Ray!
雷雷！

09:56.505 --> 09:58.677
[chuckles nervously]
[紧张地笑]

09:58.746 --> 10:01.815
Uh, which one of us is Ray Ray?
呃，我们当中哪一个是雷雷？

10:01.884 --> 10:03.608
I am, you doofus!
我就是，你这个笨蛋！

10:03.677 --> 10:06.125
Well...
well, I'm Ray Ray too!
嗯...
好吧，我也是雷雷！

10:06.194 --> 10:08.057
No, I'm Ray Ray!
不，我是雷雷！

10:08.125 --> 10:10.574
I don't care
who is the real one!
我不在乎
谁才是真人啊！

10:10.643 --> 10:13.436
You can both watch
this formula get deleted.
你们都可以观看
该公式被删除。

10:13.505 --> 10:16.022
Eee, Karen!
Darling, sweetie!
呃，凯伦！
亲爱的，亲爱的！

10:16.091 --> 10:18.125
Please, let's talk about this!
拜托，我们来谈谈这个吧！

10:18.194 --> 10:21.194
[hysterical crying]
[歇斯底里的哭泣]

10:21.263 --> 10:24.194
Don't mess with date night, Plankton.
别搞乱约会之夜，浮游生物。

10:24.263 --> 10:26.436
Aaah...
啊啊……

10:28.988 --> 10:30.712
Oh.
Nom, nom.
哦。
名义，名义。

10:34.608 --> 10:38.022
Now this is truly
a wonderful date, Plankton.
现在这确实是
一次美妙的约会，浮游生物。

10:38.091 --> 10:42.574
And thank you for giving me
your undivided attention.
谢谢你给我
你的全神贯注。

10:42.643 --> 10:45.436
I wouldn't miss it
for the world, baby.
我不会错过它
为了世界，宝贝。

10:45.505 --> 10:49.057
- Aah.
- ♪ La da dee la da lee! ♪
- 啊啊。
- ♪ La da dee la da lee！ ♪

10:49.125 --> 10:51.194
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

10:51.263 --> 10:53.570
Oh, boy.
哦，男孩。

哦，男孩。